---
const navItems = [
  { href: '/website', label: '网站建设' },
  { href: '/marketing', label: '全网营销' },
  { href: '/seo', label: 'Google SEO' },
  { href: '/geo', label: 'GEO 优化' },
  { href: '/cases', label: '成功案例' },
];
---

<footer class="bg-primary text-white/70">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] gap-8 px-4 py-12 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-6 md:py-16">
    <div>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white"
          >远</span
        >
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">远航</span>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
        面向外贸与品牌出海场景，提供独立站建设、全网营销、Google SEO 与 GEO 优化服务。（演示品牌）
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
      <p class="font-semibold text-white">页面导航</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
        {
          navItems.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a href={item.href} class="hover:text-white">
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="text-sm">
      <p class="font-semibold text-white">联系方式（演示占位）</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
        <li>
          邮箱：<a href="mailto:demo@example.com" class="underline hover:text-white">
            demo@example.com
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          电话：<a href="tel:+8600000000000" class="underline hover:text-white">
            +86 000 0000 0000
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>本站为演示站，以上联系方式为占位内容。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-white/15">
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 py-6 text-sm md:px-6">
      本站为演示用途，内容与案例数据均为示例，不代表真实商业承诺。
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
